A drop of a field the target requires. The backward lens of a rename, with
the derived entry overridden by a drop, leaves 0.0 without its field.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	before: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	after: string
}

ForwardLens: (prev): {
	self: {
		after: prev.before
	}
}

BackwardLens: (self): {
	prev: {
		after: _drop
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	after: string
}
-- out/error --
error[E0346]: BackwardLens produces nothing for before, which v0.0 requires
  --> history/1.0.thema:11:1
   |
11 | BackwardLens: (self): {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: add before: <mapping> to prev
